# Files left out of the coverage total, read by `mise run test`.
#
# One extended regular expression per line. Each is matched anywhere in each
# line of the Go coverage profile, and a profile line starts with the file's
# import path, e.g. github.com/strettch-cloud/sc-metrics-agent/cmd/agent/main.go:45.13,48.2 1 0
# so `cmd/agent/main\.go:` leaves out that one file. Blank lines and lines
# starting with # are ignored.
# coverage-raw.out keeps everything, so what was left out can be checked.
#
# Every entry needs a comment above it saying why that file cannot be tested.

# Mock ingest and metadata servers for the integration tests in test/. They
# are test code, not part of the agent.
/test/helpers/

# The SC_TEST_* settings the tests in test/ give the agents they start. Only
# test builds (the e2e tag) compile it; release builds don't have it.
pkg/config/overrides_e2e\.go:
